{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114510","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114510","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1511451001:1":{"text":"Dunn, wake up.","source_cn":"顿，醒醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C5A79FBE8AD9C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511451002:0":{"text":"Ugh... Nazrik? Why am I here?","source_cn":"唔……那非？我怎么在这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD936C5FC08CA1080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511451003:0":{"text":"My head hurts...","source_cn":"嘶……！我的头好疼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C1512120D4E8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511451004:1":{"text":"That was me. I had no choice. I had to knock you out.","source_cn":"是我打的。为了制服你，我只能这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BAB7F441D355445","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511451005:0":{"text":"What? Why did you hit me?!","source_cn":"你！你没事干嘛打我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B20CE933E5FA2B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511451006:0":{"text":"... You don't remember what just happened?","source_cn":"……你不记得刚才发生的事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDD9BF709E91D924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511451007:0":{"text":"Remember what? That you punched me a few times?","source_cn":"我该记得什么？你给了我几拳吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD222D935C48A95D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511451008:0":{"text":"You must've hit me hard enough to knock the memories right out of me, huh? Damn, that hurts...","source_cn":"噢，这么说来，我就是被你给打失忆了吧！嘶，真疼啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D33C76348F49E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511451009:0":{"text":"Wait, where's Ames? I should've been with her...","source_cn":"对了，阿米呢？我原本应该和她在一起的啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2D877E03FA4ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511451010:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1511451011:1":{"text":"Nazrik explains everything to Dunn.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63ACC4F3B42E80A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1511451012:1":{"text":"Mehira's trickery... Ames' death...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54486652CFCFD0EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511451013:0":{"text":"<sad>Ames... Why... why did it end like this?</sad>","source_cn":"<sad>阿米……为什么……为什么会这样？</sad>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D860CAC07E217BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511451014:0":{"text":"I didn't even see through that Hypogean's disguise. I walked right into her trap...","source_cn":"我……我非但没看破那个恶魔的伪装，还上了她的当……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CCBBBF3B96070F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511451015:0":{"text":"It should've been me who avenged her! That Hypogean murdered Ames...","source_cn":"我应该替阿米报仇的！是那个恶魔杀了她——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6864E3AF671629F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511451016:0":{"text":"<shk>It's all my fault! I was too weak...</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>都是……都是我的错！是我太没用了……！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48907F0F01A4D596","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511451017:0":{"text":"... Don't torment yourself, Dunn.","source_cn":"……别伤心了，顿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75655DE3E715D137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511451018:0":{"text":"I've already avenged Ames and the warriors who were deceived.","source_cn":"我已经替阿米，还有那些受到蛊惑的战士报仇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5DFE1BFF8DD143","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511451019:0":{"text":"I... I still can't forgive myself...","source_cn":"我……我还是不能原谅自己……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x217312A6AD6173D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511451020:0":{"text":"Then if you really want to do something for Ames, bring back the prey we caught. Win the Bloodhunt Festival for her.","source_cn":"……如果你真想为阿米做点什么，就带着我们一起打到的猎物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC6C52D22973575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511451021:0":{"text":"I've counted. Aside from you and me, every warrior is gone. Some torn apart by beasts, the rest turned on each other under the Hypogean's lies.","source_cn":"我算过人数。除了你我，其他战士要么死在了野兽爪下，要么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE00B9BF2F55A6EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511451022:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">We're the only survivors.</style> If we return to Wrathwood Grove with our prey, Ames and Tase will stand beside us in spirit, forever honored under the Wild Moon.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>你我是唯一的幸存者<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DAD7253E2711A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1511451023:0":{"text":"... You're right. For Ames and Tase, I have to stay strong...","source_cn":"……对，你说的对。为了阿米和泰泽，我得振作起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC381683BE88401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511451024:0":{"text":"But the Herdmaster... why did she just watch while the Hypogean ruined the festival? Why didn't she intervene?","source_cn":"可是兽群之主……她为什么坐视恶魔破坏猎血节，却不加以制止？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD927567A81D0FC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1511451025:1":{"text":"... I don't know.","source_cn":"……我不知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x308312031E0B19C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1511451026:0":{"text":"Maybe the goddess never even turned her gaze this way—maybe she's just waiting to see who remains standing...","source_cn":"或许，神并没有真正将目光投来，她只是在等待结果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D740B6786D1331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1511451026":{"text":"Maybe the goddess never even turned her gaze this way—maybe she's just waiting to see who remains standing...","source_cn":"或许，神并没有真正将目光投来，她只是在等待结果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51D740B6786D1331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1511451027:0":{"text":"Either way, let's head back to camp.","source_cn":"总之，先回我们营地去吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A4F1133D735D30A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"(Bite back the urge to curse the Hunting Goddess)","source_cn":"（忍住吐槽狩猎神的欲望）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC8F7211F3441BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Bite back the urge to curse the Hunting Goddess)","female":"(Bite back the urge to curse the Hunting Goddess)","variant_male_record_index":"79923","variant_female_record_index":"79924","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:1:2":{"text":"(Let out a weary sigh)","source_cn":"（无奈地叹气）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10494DDC5B24E471","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Let out a weary sigh)","female":"(Let out a weary sigh)","variant_male_record_index":"79925","variant_female_record_index":"79926","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:那非":{"text":"Nazrik","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:顿":{"text":"Dunn","source":"顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":31,"localized_text_count":30,"speaker_count":3}}